# Images

This directory contains visual assets used throughout the Supply Chain Analytics portfolio.

Visualisations support project documentation by communicating analytical findings and operational insights.

Examples include:

- Warehouse Layouts
- Dashboard Screenshots
- Inventory Charts
- Pareto Diagrams
- Forecasting Visualisations
- KPI Dashboards
- Process Flow Diagrams
- Transportation Maps
- Performance Charts

Images are included within project reports and README files to enhance interpretation and communication of results.
